<!--
  The settings: a window of their own, opened from File > Settings (spec/10-platforms.md:
  "a settings page or dialog"). spec/06-library.md, "Settings", has them in sections.
  So far there is one, Backups: the copies that are kept, all of them (AllCopiesView).
  The chords' colours are the editors' milestones.

  It is opened over the app's window and is to be closed before that is gone back to:
  nothing in it changes a song, and what it shows of the copies is as they were when it
  was opened.

  A window only frames what is in it. What is in it is a view of its own, put in by the
  code beside this, so that a test can draw it into a picture.
-->
<Window x:Class="Pro7ChordEditor.AppViews.SettingsWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="Settings"
        Width="960"
        Height="560"
        MinWidth="760"
        MinHeight="420"
        ShowInTaskbar="False"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner" />
